+/**
+ * Heuristically checks whether the `<` at `index` opens type arguments in an
+ * initializer (`new Map<string, X>()`, `foo<A, B>(x)`) rather than being a
+ * comparison (`1<2`). It must follow an identifier and its matching `>` must be
